From: LuneOS Developers <luneos@webos-ports.org>
Date: Sat, 19 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libconnman-qt.pro: Disable hidden symbol visibility for Qt6

Qt6 applies -fvisibility=hidden to library builds, causing SessionAgent
and other class methods to be hidden from the dynamic symbol table.
libConnmanQtDeclarative.so (the QML plugin) depends on these symbols;
loading it fails at runtime with "undefined symbol: _ZN12SessionAgentD1Ev".

Add CONFIG -= hide_symbols to ensure all symbols are exported, matching
Qt5 behaviour.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 libconnman-qt/libconnman-qt.pro | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libconnman-qt/libconnman-qt.pro b/libconnman-qt/libconnman-qt.pro
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/libconnman-qt/libconnman-qt.pro
+++ b/libconnman-qt/libconnman-qt.pro
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 QT          += core dbus network
 QT          -= gui
 CONFIG      += qt create_pc create_prl link_pkgconfig
+CONFIG      -= hide_symbols

 isEmpty(VERSION) {
     VERSION = 1.2.35
